# Security headers for every static page. (Pages Functions set their own.)
#
# Nothing here loads from Patreon: sign-in is a full-page redirect and the
# Patreon buttons are our own drawings, so patreon.com is in no directive.
# PostHog normally goes through /relay on this origin; its hosts stay in
# connect-src for the parts of posthog-js that talk to PostHog directly, such
# as its toolbar. Nothing uses geolocation. COOP severs the link to any window
# that opened this one, which the Patreon redirect does not need.
#
# Only dmOS may frame BattleTracker: it shows the app in a window and talks to
# /bridge (src/bridge.ts) in a hidden frame. frame-ancestors names it; there
# is no X-Frame-Options, whose DENY would win over the allowance in older
# browsers and has no way to name a single site.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' *.posthog.com *.i.posthog.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://dmos.simulacrumtechnologies.com; object-src 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# The player page (/play/<code>, rewritten to /play) also opens inside a
# player's sheet: Simulacrum Sheets shows a campaign's initiative paper there
# during a fight (src/utils/fightPapers.ts). Only this page; the rest of
# BattleTracker stays framable by dmOS alone. The policy is detached and
# restated whole rather than added to, because Pages joins two of the same
# header with a comma, a browser enforces every policy it is given, and the
# general one would still forbid Sheets.
/play/*
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' *.posthog.com *.i.posthog.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://dmos.simulacrumtechnologies.com https://sheets.simulacrumtechnologies.com; object-src 'none'

/play
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' *.posthog.com *.i.posthog.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://dmos.simulacrumtechnologies.com https://sheets.simulacrumtechnologies.com; object-src 'none'
